{"parentUuid":"1655c9a5-1282-4ce3-80d7-85a15cc8f767","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"5ff814e4-85fe-4246-b854-2e4f43ea2e9f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AMo4NqBsxpKyN7q5iB76Gt","type":"tool_result","content":"  3. **Inter-Process Advisory Locking (Anti-Race Invariant)** *[Agent + Maintainer]*: Every read-modify-write of a state file holds an advisory lock file (`<file>.lock`) acquired with a 3-second timeout; a lock older than 30 seconds is broken by an atomic rename, and a timeout raises an error with the triad, never a write without the lock.\n  4. **Dual-Slot Shadow Snapshots & Schema Migration (`.bak` Fallback)** *[Agent + Maintainer]*: Before replacing a state file, code copies the current one to `<file>.bak`. On load, a file that does not parse is renamed to `<file>.corrupt_<epoch>`, the `.bak` is loaded instead, and the result passes through the schema migration (`migrate_ledger_schema` for the ledger) before an empty default is used. A file that parses but declares a version the reader does not support is refused in place: it is never quarantined, overwritten or replaced by an older backup. Each of these steps that fails prints a warning naming the file.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"0a7326d5-f21a-403c-b15a-299de92559f5","timestamp":"2026-10-19T15:30:32.084Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"  3. **Inter-Process Advisory Locking (Anti-Race Invariant)** *[Agent + Maintainer]*: Every read-modify-write of a state file holds an advisory lock file (`<file>.lock`) acquired with a 3-second timeout; a lock older than 30 seconds is broken by an atomic rename, and a timeout raises an error with the triad, never a write without the lock.\n  4. **Dual-Slot Shadow Snapshots & Schema Migration (`.bak` Fallback)** *[Agent + Maintainer]*: Before replacing a state file, code copies the current one to `<file>.bak`. On load, a file that does not parse is renamed to `<file>.corrupt_<epoch>`, the `.bak` is loaded instead, and the result passes through the schema migration (`migrate_ledger_schema` for the ledger) before an empty default is used. A file that parses but declares a version the reader does not support is refused in place: it is never quarantined, overwritten or replaced by an older backup. Each of these steps that fails prints a warning naming the file.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"8b7a994e-0aae-4054-a449-7646b4bbac70","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit","root":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":4,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/AIKit","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/AIKit","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/AIKit","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1655c9a5-1282-4ce3-80d7-85a15cc8f767","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit","sessionId":"07a11155-9f67-48dd-9986-2d892e5f4e3f","version":"2.1.302","gitBranch":"main","slug":"eager-humming-wave"}
