{"parentUuid":"10e70ec1-e0f3-45c2-8c4a-cdc70c727b42","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgBqWD8mujmg5taQniot4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019QKEuFzEpKWJHAqry9zBbq","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"MSG=\"fix(ledger): [milestone 2/5] an unreadable ledger is reported\"; py scripts/disruption_recovery.py --validate-commit \"$MSG\" && py scripts/disruption_recovery.py --checkpoint review-fixes-2 --phase-num 5 --desc \"[milestone 2/5] committed: load_ledger re-raises OSError, replace retries PermissionError only, P013 R4 clause (ADR-146)\" | tail -1 && git add .agents/task_ledger.json GUIDELINES.md knowledge/codebase_map.md knowledge/decisions.md scripts/disruption_recovery.py tests/test_kit.py 2>&1 | grep -v \"LF will\"; py scripts/check_secrets.py --staged >/dev/null 2>&1 && test -z \"$(git status --short | grep -v '^[AM] ')\" && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF' && git push -q && git log --oneline -1\nfix(ledger): [milestone 2/5] an unreadable ledger is reported\n\nA ledger that was merely locked or permission-denied took the same path\nas malformed JSON: renamed to *.corrupt_*, replaced by an older .bak or\nan empty ledger, losing the active task on a fault that says nothing\nabout the content. `load_ledger` now re-raises OSError so the CLI prints\nthe triad and exits 1; quarantine stays for content that does not parse.\n`os.replace` retries PermissionError only, as PRINCIPLE-013 R1 already\nrequired, so a full disk fails at once instead of five times. R4 gains\nthe clause that an unreadable file has not failed to parse (ADR-146).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF","description":"Commit and push milestone 2 with valid subject","timeout":120000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":825,"cache_read_input_tokens":726107,"output_tokens":10