{"parentUuid":"1895cba7-9463-4c45-946d-d211f1af4a7a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c3602802-0490-4257-a831-b5d201a35c9d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QPRRQWiEyPj3uWoFZxeSyS","type":"tool_result","content":"ok\r\n[ERROR] 8 target(s) breach the Tier 1 context budget (PRINCIPLE-001).\n[TIER 1B HEADROOM] AGENTS.md: ~1293 tokens leaves room for only ~295 of the promised ~300 Tier 1B tokens\n[TIER 1B HEADROOM] GEMINI.md: ~1293 tokens leaves room for only ~295 of the promised ~300 Tier 1B tokens","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"429811cb-ba58-417e-ac00-a9edc4fa9e5e","timestamp":"2026-10-19T15:50:00.181Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"ok\r\n[ERROR] 8 target(s) breach the Tier 1 context budget (PRINCIPLE-001).\n[TIER 1B HEADROOM] AGENTS.md: ~1293 tokens leaves room for only ~295 of the promised ~300 Tier 1B tokens\n[TIER 1B HEADROOM] GEMINI.md: ~1293 tokens leaves room for only ~295 of the promised ~300 Tier 1B tokens","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\GUIDELINES.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":315,"oldLines":7,"newStart":315,"newLines":7,"lines":[" ### PRINCIPLE-018: Automatic Git Workflow (Commit & Push)\r"," - **Problem**: Uncommitted work is lost; blind staging sweeps secrets and clutter into commits; diverged remotes tempt force-pushes; destructive resets erase work. When the rules claim a lock that does not exist, list only some blind-staging forms or give one rollback for every case, each model takes different risks with the user's history.\r"," - **Concept**: The agent commits each verified unit of work with a checked message, stages files by name, pushes without force, and undoes mistakes without discarding anything. The gates are enforced by the agent running them, not by a hook.\r","-- **Invariant**: Automatic conventional commits (`--validate-commit`) + adaptive push, unless the user opts out, never forced; explicit staging (zero `git add .`); pre-commit delivery triad (tests, read-only gates, staged diff); the commit itself verified before the push (`verify_commit.py`); non-destructive recoil.\r","+- **Invariant**: Automatic conventional commits (`--validate-commit`) + adaptive push, never forced; explicit staging (zero `git add .`); pre-commit delivery triad (tests, gates, staged diff); the commit verified before the push (`verify_commit.py`); non-destructive recoil.\r"," - **Rules**:\r","   1. **Automatic Conventional Commits** *[Agent]*: When Phase 4 passes for a milestone or a task (PRINCIPLE-006 R1), the agent commits, unless the user said not to commit; then it stops after Phase 4 and reports the uncommitted files. The subject is `type(scope): description` or `type(scope): [milestone N/M] description`, with a type from `feat`, `fix`, `refactor`, `docs`, `chore`, `test`, `perf`, `build`, `ci`, and at most 72 characters; `python scripts/disruption_recovery.py --validate-commit \"<message>\"` MUST pass before the commit.\r","   2. **Explicit Staging Invariant (Zero Blind Staging)** *[Agent]*: The agent stages files only by name (`git add <file> ...`). It MUST NOT run `git add .`, `git add -A`, `git add --all`, `git add -u` or `git commit -a`."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\GUIDELINES.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"c39b3720-61c4-4d16-939c-3dcea738387d","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit","root":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":7,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/AIKit","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/AIKit","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"g