{"parentUuid":"38efebbc-ac66-4e32-b653-4bb53384ea9d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CgBs4uCJw483d3vbMFmoN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QGGpJiC9tKiR933mbHC1HA","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"awk '/^## 📥 Alternative/,/^## 🏛️ The 20 Core/' README.md | head -40","description":"Read the adopter-copy section in full"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":528,"cache_read_input_tokens":819120,"output_tokens":1108,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":901},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":528,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1108,"cache_read_input_tokens":819120,"cache_creation_input_tokens":528,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":528},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01QGGpJiC9tKiR933mbHC1HA":{"command":"cd /c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit && awk '/^## 📥 Alternative/,/^## 🏛️ The 20 Core/' README.md | head -40","description":"Read the adopter-copy section in full"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01QGGpJiC9tKiR933mbHC1HA":{"cwd":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"df120989-58c1-410b-826f-16d2d3f25c6c","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgBs4tk2LxHRNCgQCuyBu","requestRef":"e97296f1-233d-44a1-9372-c57b7e2f3e0c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"1bfb9a82-8c6a-46ef-a155-223d276c4e52","timestamp":"2026-10-19T15:52:40.088Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit","sessionId":"07a11155-9f67-48dd-9986-2d892e5f4e3f","version":"2.1.302","gitBranch":"main","slug":"eager-humming-wave"}
{"parentUuid":"1bfb9a82-8c6a-46ef-a155-223d276c4e52","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c3602802-0490-4257-a831-b5d201a35c9d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QGGpJiC9tKiR933mbHC1HA","type":"tool_result","content":"## 📥 Alternative: Copy AIKit Into an Existing Project\n\n### Step 1: Copy Governance Assets\n\n- Copy the source of truth and tooling; Tier 1 files are generated in Step 3, never copied:\n  ```bash\n  cd portable_agent_kit\n  mkdir -p /path/to/target/.agents\n  cp -r GUIDELINES.md scripts knowledge /path/to/target/\n  cp -r .agents/rules .agents/skills /path/to/target/.agents/\n  ```\n  Do **not** copy `tests/`, `.github/` or `.agents/task_ledger.json` (AIKit's own); the CLI gates above carry enforcement. Replace copied `knowledge/` documents with your project's, and copy `.agents/rules/readme_quickref.md.template` into your `README.md`, replacing `<FILL` placeholders.\n\n### Step 2: Move Your Own Agent Instructions into Tier 1B\nIf the target already has instruction files, move project-specific rules into `.agents/rules/domain.md` (max 1,200 chars), then delete the originals. Sync injects the block into every generated file and never overwrites hand-authored files without a generated header (`[PROTECTED]`).\n\n### Step 3: Run Principle Synchronization\nGenerate every Tier 1 file from `GUIDELINES.md`:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/sync_principles.py\n```\nThis writes all 8 Tier 1 files (`AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `GEMINI.md`, `.cursorrules`, `.github/copilot-instructions.md`, `.windsurfrules`, `.clinerules`, `.agents/rules/principles.md`), each <=1,600 tokens including Tier 1B.\n\n### Step 4: Generate Your Knowledge Base\nRun the knowledge base AST scanner to automatically index your project's classes and functions:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/update_knowledge_base.py\n```\nThis generates `knowledge/codebase_map.md` with every exported class, method, argument, and docstring.\n\n\n---\n\n## 🏛️ The 20 Core Principles (Lifecycle-Ordered)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"4ac9bc04-11da-4a74-aa0e-c3d9ee4ea57e","timestamp":"2026-10-19T15:52:40.915Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"## 📥 Alternative: Copy AIKit Into an Existing Project\n\n### Step 1: Copy Governance Assets\n\n- Copy the source of truth and tooling; Tier 1 files are generated in Step 3, never copied:\n  ```bash\n  cd portable_agent_kit\n  mkdir -p /path/to/target/.agents\n  cp -r GUIDELINES.md scripts knowledge /path/to/target/\n  cp -r .agents/rules .agents/skills /path/to/target/.agents/\n  ```\n  Do **not** copy `tests/`, `.github/` or `.agents/task_ledger.json` (AIKit's own); the CLI gates above carry enforcement. Replace copied `knowledge/` documents with your project's, and copy `.agents/rules/readme_quickref.md.template` into your `README.md`, replacing `<FILL` placeholders.\n\n### Step 2: Move Your Own Agent Instructions into Tier 1B\nIf the target already has instruction files, move project-specific rules into `.agents/rules/domain.md` (max 1,200 chars), then delete the originals. Sync injects the block into every generated file and never overwrites hand-authored files without a generated header (`[PROTECTED]`).\n\n### Step 3: Run Principle Synchronization\nGenerate every Tier 1 file from `GUIDELINES.md`:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/sync_principles.py\n```\nThis writes all 8 Tier 1 files (`AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `GEMINI.md`, `.cursorrules`, `.github/copilot-instructions.md`, `.windsurfrules`, `.clinerules`, `.agents/rules/principles.md`), each <=1,600 tokens including Tier 1B.\n\n### Step 4: Generate Your Knowledge Base\nRun the knowledge base AST scanner to automatically index your project's classes and functions:\n\n```bash\npython scripts/update_knowledge_base.py\n```\nThis generates `knowledge/codebase_map.md` with every exported class, method, argument, and docstring.\n\n\n---\n\n## 🏛️ The 20 Core Principles (Lifecycle-Ordered)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"df120989-58c1-410b-826f-16d2d3f25c6c","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit","root":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":15,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/AIKit","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/AIKit","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/AIKit","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1bfb9a82-8c6a-46ef-a155-223d276c4e52","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit","sessionId":"07a11155-9f67-48dd-9986-2d892e5f4e3f","version":"2.1.302","gitBranch":"main","slug":"eager-humming-wave"}
