very Tier 1 file from `GUIDELINES.md`:\r","-\r","-```bash\r","-python scripts/sync_principles.py\r","-```\r","-This writes all 8 Tier 1 files (`AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `GEMINI.md`, `.cursorrules`, `.github/copilot-instructions.md`, `.windsurfrules`, `.clinerules`, `.agents/rules/principles.md`), each <=1,600 tokens including Tier 1B.\r","-\r","-### Step 4: Generate Your Knowledge Base\r","-Run the knowledge base AST scanner to automatically index your project's classes and functions:\r","+The primary path is above: keep the project under `projects/`. To instead govern a repository in\r","+place, copy the source of truth and tooling into it and generate the rest:\r"," \r"," ```bash\r","-python scripts/update_knowledge_base.py\r","+cd portable_agent_kit\r","+mkdir -p /path/to/target/.agents\r","+cp -r GUIDELINES.md scripts knowledge /path/to/target/\r","+cp -r .agents/rules .agents/skills /path/to/target/.agents/\r","+cd /path/to/target && python scripts/sync_principles.py && python scripts/update_knowledge_base.py\r"," ```\r","-This generates `knowledge/codebase_map.md` with every exported class, method, argument, and docstring.\r"," \r","+- **Do not copy** `tests/`, `.github/` or `.agents/task_ledger.json`: they are AIKit's own. The CLI\r","+  gates in the matrix above carry the enforcement.\r","+- Replace the copied `knowledge/` documents with your project's, and copy\r","+  `.agents/rules/readme_quickref.md.template` into your `README.md`, filling every `<FILL` placeholder.\r","+- If the target already has instruction files, move their project-specific rules into\r","+  `.agents/rules/domain.md` (max 1,200 chars) and delete the originals. Sync injects that block into\r","+  all 8 Tier 1 files and refuses to overwrite a hand-authored file (`[PROTECTED]`).\r","+- The two commands above generate the 8 Tier 1 files (each <=1,600 tokens including Tier 1B) and\r","+  `knowledge/codebase_map.md`, the AST catalogue of every class, method, argument and docstring.\r"," \r"," ---\r"," "]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\README.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"69261fea-5636-44ce-ba44-3e9cf32ec51a","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit","root":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit","branch":"main","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":15,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/AIKit","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/AIKit","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Aegean-E/AIKit","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b6be8c05-8938-4a3e-b4be-5fdc7c5a89aa","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit","sessionId":"07a11155-9f67-48dd-9986-2d892e5f4e3f","version":"2.1.302","gitBranch":"main","slug":"eager-humming-wave"}
